{
  "name": "dsh-pixel-art",
  "version": "0.5.0",
  "description": "给 DeepSeek Harness 画像素画的插件：模型给字符网格、形状或内置精灵，插件本地逐格填色渲染成 PNG（手写 PNG 编码，零依赖、零成本、不联网）。没有生图能力的模型也能画；自带左侧栏画板（最大 1024×1024、缩放、撤销重做、网格线、笔刷大小、草稿自动恢复、AI 画入口）与画廊。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "icon": "icon.svg",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "render.js",
    "scene.js",
    "sprites.js",
    "templates.js",
    "board.html",
    "icon.svg",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "*"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "pixel-art",
    "minecraft",
    "text-to-image"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22"
  }
}
